---
import { courses, totalLessons } from '../lib/courses.js';
import '../styles/landing.css';
const featured = [courses[0], courses.find(c=>c.slug==='rag'), courses.find(c=>c.slug==='agents')];
const symbols = ['⌘', '◎', '✳'];
const tracks = ['Foundations', 'Retrieval systems', 'Agentic systems'];
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#000000" />
    <meta name="description" content={`Mentora: ${totalLessons} in-depth AI engineering lessons, interactive visualizations, and a course-aware AI tutor. Learn LLMs, RAG, and agents from fundamentals to production.`} />
    <meta property="og:title" content="Mentora — Learn AI from the inside out" />
    <meta property="og:description" content="A deeper way to learn AI engineering. Guided courses, interactive labs, and a built-in AI tutor." />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/mentora-icon.svg" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:ital,opsz,wght@0,14..32,100..900&family=Instrument+Serif:ital@1&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
    <title>Mentora — Learn AI from the inside out</title>
  </head>
  <body class="landing" style="background:#000000;color:#ffffff">
    <a class="skip-to-content" href="#main">Skip to content</a>
    <div class="noise" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="ambient ambient--one" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="ambient ambient--two" aria-hidden="true"></div>

    <header class="landing-header" id="top">
      <div class="header-inner">
        <a href="/" class="brand" aria-label="Mentora home">
          <span class="brand-mark" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 36 36" fill="none"><path d="M7 25.5V10l11 12 11-12v15.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/><circle cx="29" cy="8" r="2" fill="#b7b7b7"/></svg></span>
          <span>mentora<span class="brand-period">.</span></span>
        </a>
        <nav class="desktop-nav" aria-label="Main navigation">
          <a href="#curriculum">Explore courses</a>
          <a href="#method">How it works</a>
          <a href="#ai-tutor">AI tutor</a>
        </nav>
        <div class="header-actions"><a class="header-signin" href="/academy/">View academy <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><button class="mobile-menu-button" id="landing-menu-button" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="mobile-landing-nav" aria-label="Open navigation"><span></span><span></span><span></span></button></div>
      </div>
      <nav id="mobile-landing-nav" class="mobile-landing-nav" aria-label="Mobile navigation" hidden>
        <a href="#curriculum">Explore courses</a><a href="#method">How it works</a><a href="#ai-tutor">AI tutor</a><a href="/academy/">Open academy ↗</a>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <main id="main">
      <section class="landing-hero" aria-labelledby="hero-heading">
        <div class="hero-background-grid" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="landing-container hero-grid">
          <div class="hero-left">
            <div class="hero-eyebrow"><span class="live-spark">✳</span> THE AI ENGINEERING LEARNING SPACE <span class="eyebrow-rule"></span> EST. 2026</div>
            <h1 id="hero-heading">Curiosity meets<br/><span class="headline-em">understanding.</span></h1>
            <p class="hero-lede">Don't just learn what AI can do. Understand <strong>how it works.</strong> Go from your first Transformer to building production-grade AI systems—with a mentor beside you.</p>
            <div class="hero-ctas"><a class="action-primary" href="/academy/">Start learning <svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 10h12m-5-5 5 5-5 5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></a><a class="action-text" href="#curriculum">Explore the curriculum <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
            <div class="hero-social-proof"><div class="proof-icon" aria-hidden="true"><span>✧</span></div><span>One place for the <b>theory, the code, and the why.</b></span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="learning-metrics" aria-label="Learning library at a glance"><div class="landing-container metrics-inner"><div class="metric"><b>11<span class="metric-glint">+</span></b><span>STRUCTURED COURSES</span></div><div class="metric"><b>{totalLessons}</b><span>DETAILED LESSONS</span></div><div class="metric"><b>1,404</b><span>INTERVIEW FRAMEWORK SECTIONS</span></div><div class="metric metric-last"><b>24<span class="metric-glint">/7</span></b><span>AI STUDY COMPANION*</span></div></div></section>

      <section id="curriculum" class="curriculum-section section-pad"><div class="landing-container">
        <div class="section-topline"><span class="section-label"><span class="purple-marker"></span> 01 / YOUR LEARNING PATH</span><span class="section-aside">A CURATED CURRICULUM, NOT ANOTHER TAB TO CLOSE</span></div>
        <div class="section-heading"><div><h2>Complex ideas.<br/><em>Clearly connected.</em></h2></div><p>Follow a course from the fundamentals to real production decisions. Every lesson is built for technical depth, not just quick definitions.</p></div>
        <div class="featured-grid">
          {featured.map((course,i) => <a href={`/course/${course.slug}/`} class={`featured-card featured-card--${i+1}`} style={`--reveal-delay:${i*110}ms`}>
            <div class="featured-card-header"><span>{String(i+1).padStart(2,'0')} / {tracks[i]}</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="featured-arrow">↗</span></div>
            <div class="featured-icon" aria-hidden="true">{symbols[i]}</div>
            <div class="featured-card-content"><span class="featured-mini">{course.count} IN-DEPTH LESSONS</span><h3>{i===0?'Understand language models.':i===1?'Build retrieval that works.':'Engineer intelligent agents.'}</h3><p>{course.description}</p></div>
            <div class="featured-bottom"><span>EXPLORE COURSE</span><span>↗</span></div>
          </a>)}
        </div>
        <a href="/academy/" class="all-courses-link"><span>View all {courses.length} courses in the academy</span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </div></section>

      <section id="method" class="method-section section-pad"><div class="landing-container">
        <div class="section-topline"><span class="section-label"><span class="purple-marker"></span> 02 / LEARN WITH DEPTH</span><span class="section-aside">BUILT FOR THE WAY ENGINEERS THINK</span></div>
        <div class="method-grid"><div class="method-heading"><h2>Knowledge should<br/><em>feel alive.</em></h2><p>Go beyond memorization. Visualize a mechanism, test an idea, and explain why an architecture works—or doesn't.</p><a class="inline-link" href="/academy/">Experience the learning studio <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><div class="steps-list">
          <div class="method-step"><span class="step-index">01</span><div><span class="method-icon">◎</span><h3>Understand the why.</h3><p>Derivations, architecture internals, edge cases, and trade-offs written for real AI engineers.</p></div><span class="step-arrow">↗</span></div>
          <div class="method-step"><span class="step-index">02</span><div><span class="method-icon">⌘</span><h3>Experiment, don't guess.</h3><p>Animated diagrams and interactive labs turn abstract systems into something you can actually explore.</p></div><span class="step-arrow">↗</span></div>
          <div class="method-step"><span class="step-index">03</span><div><span class="method-icon">✧</span><h3>Think like an interviewer.</h3><p>Practice spoken answers, challenge assumptions, and debug realistic production failures.</p></div><span class="step-arrow">↗</span></div>
        </div></div>
      </div></section>

      <section id="ai-tutor" class="ai-section section-pad"><div class="landing-container"><div class="ai-showcase">
        <div class="ai-copy"><div class="section-label"><span class="purple-marker"></span> 03 / A MENTOR IN YOUR CORNER</div><h2>Questions welcome.<br/><em>Always.</em></h2><p>Every lesson comes with a context-aware AI tutor. Ask it to unpack the math, pressure-test your understanding, or run a senior engineering mock interview.</p><div class="ai-points"><span><i>✓</i> Lesson-aware explanations</span><span><i>✓</i> Technical interview practice</span><span><i>✓</i> Production scenario walkthroughs</span></div><a class="action-primary" href="/academy/">Meet your AI tutor <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><small>*Connect your own 9router endpoint to enable live AI responses.</small></div>
        <div class="tutor-demo" aria-label="Preview of the Mentora AI tutor conversation"><div class="demo-top"><span class="demo-avatar">✳</span><div><strong>Mentora AI tutor</strong><span><i class="art-status-dot"></i> YOUR STUDY PARTNER</span></div><span class="demo-top-right">✧</span></div><div class="demo-thread"><div class="demo-user"><span>YOU</span><p>Why does KV caching speed up token generation?</p></div><div class="demo-assistant"><span>✧ MENTORA</span><p>Without a cache, every decoding step recomputes the keys and values for all previous tokens.</p><p><strong>KV caching</strong> stores those past representations, so the model only computes K and V for each new token. It trades memory for much less redundant computation.</p><div class="demo-source">↗ &nbsp; MODULE 6 · ATTENTION OPTIMIZATION</div></div></div><div class="demo-composer"><span>Ask a follow-up question…</span><span>↑</span></div></div>
      </div></div></section>

      <section class="bottom-cta section-pad"><div class="landing-container"><div class="cta-inner"><div class="cta-orbit" aria-hidden="true">✳</div><p class="section-label">YOUR NEXT CHAPTER STARTS HERE</p><h2>Don't just keep up.<br/><em>Understand what's next.</em></h2><p>Explore all 234 lessons. Learn the foundations, build the intuition, and make the engineering decisions that matter.</p><a href="/academy/" class="action-primary">Enter the academy <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div></section>
    </main>

    <footer class="landing-footer"><div class="landing-container footer-inner"><a href="/" class="brand footer-brand"><span class="brand-mark" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 36 36" fill="none"><path d="M7 25.5V10l11 12 11-12v15.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/><circle cx="29" cy="8" r="2" fill="#b7b7b7"/></svg></span><span>mentora<span class="brand-period">.</span></span></a><span>LEARN DEEPLY. BUILD CONFIDENTLY.</span><div><a href="/academy/">ACADEMY ↗</a><a href="#top">BACK TO TOP ↑</a></div><small>© 2026 MENTORA</small></div></footer>
    <script src="/landing.js" is:inline defer></script>
  </body>
</html>
